  "word_count": 769,
  "body_markdown": "(310)-481-0111\n\nDental Implants\n\nDental Implant Surgery\n\nAll-on-4® Dental Implants\n\nHybrid Fixed Detachable Denture\n\nZirconia Fixed Bridge\n\nImplant Supported Dentures\n\nRobotic Surgery\n\nCost & Compare\n\nWhat To Expect\n\nFAQ\n\nAesthetic Dentistry\n\nCosmetic Dentistry\n\nPorcelain Veneers & Lumineers\n\nInvisalign\n\nTeeth Whitening\n\nSmile Makeover\n\nServices\n\nIV Sedation\n\nBone Grafting\n\nRidge Augmentation\n\nSinus Augmentation\n\nTooth Extractions\n\nGeneral Dentistry\n\nPeriodontics\n\nConditions We Treat\n\nMissing Teeth\n\nBone Loss\n\nFailing Dental Implants\n\nLoose Dentures\n\nPatient Center\n\nInsurance & Financing\n\nOur Facility\n\nPatient Stories\n\nBefore & After Photos\n\nWho We Are\n\nCommitment To Excellence\n\nMeet Dr. Tony Barriere\n\nMeet The Team\n\nVideo Library\n\nBlog\n\nContact Us\n\nPatient Portal\n\nNew Patients\n\nCurrent Patients\n\n\n# Teeth Whitening\n\n\n\n# Teeth Whitening - Los Angeles, CA\n\n\n\n## A White Smile in Just One Visit\n\n\n\n## The Professional Teeth Whitening Advantage\n\n\nIf you’re dissatisfied with the color of your teeth, you’ve probably attempted to whiten them yourself. Over-the-counter whitening strips, brightening toothpaste, home remedies like oil pulling or baking soda. While all these options may subtly brighten your stained teeth, most patients don’t see the results they desire using these methods. Your best solution to brighten your teeth, and have the results last long-term, is professional teeth whitening from a qualified cosmetic dentist! Our team at West LA Implants offers affordable, office-based teeth whitening in Los Angeles, CA with professional-grade bleaching agents that can brighten your teeth multiple shades lighter in just one visit to our office.\n\n\n## Get a Brighter, Confident Smile\n\n\nZoom Teeth Whitening is a cosmetic dental procedure that uses a special light-activated gel to whiten and brighten teeth. During the treatment, a protective barrier is placed on the gums and lips to shield them from the gel. The gel is then applied to the teeth and activated with a special light, which helps to break down stains and discoloration. The process typically takes about an hour, and multiple treatments may be necessary for desired results. Zoom Teeth Whitening is considered a safe and effective way to improve the appearance of teeth and achieve a brighter, more youthful-looking smile.\n\n\n## Comparing Teeth Whitening Solutions\n\n\nProfessional teeth whitening is one of the most popular cosmetic dentistry procedures our patients choose, and for good reason. This solution has numerous benefits that other methods can’t offer. Over-the-counter whitening strips may work for some time, but often cause tooth and gum sensitivity and wear down the tooth enamel if used too often. Home remedies, such as baking soda, activated charcoal, and whitening toothpaste may show minimal changes in tooth color but are often abrasive and can result in enamel erosion and tooth sensitivity as well. In almost all cases with these methods, results may take weeks or even months to show, and even then, they may be minimal.\n\n\n## Why Choose Professional Treatment?\n\n\nNo other teeth whitening solution provides the instantaneous and dramatic results in just a few hours as that of our professional teeth whitening services in Los Angeles, CA. The professional-grade bleaching agents found in our whitening solutions soak deep into your tooth enamel, to remove internal as well as surface-level stains. Additionally, most patients report that they did not experience any tooth or gum sensitivity during or after their whitening session. Our cosmetic dentist helps you choose the most complementary shade and monitor your treatment for the best possible results. Generally, if you maintain a good oral hygiene routine, professional cleanings, and minimize teeth-staining foods and beverages, your teeth have the potential to remain noticeably white long-term!\n\nView More Results\n\n\n## The Advantages of Professional Teeth Bleaching\n\n\nQuick treatment (generally one hour)\n\nInstantaneous and dramatic results\n\nLittle-to-no tooth or gum sensitivity\n\nNo messy or abrasive products\n\nWhite shade customized to you\n\n\n## Want brighter teeth?\n\n\nReserve your whitening session in Los Angeles, CA now.\n\nCall Now\n\nFacebook Instagram Youtube Yelp Google\n\n\n#### Contact Us\n\n\nAddress:\n\n12301 Wilshire Blvd Suite 205,\n\nLos Angeles, CA 90025\n\n(310) 481-0111\n\n\n#### Hours\n\n\nMonday: 9:00am – 5:00pm\n\nTuesday: 9:00am – 5:00pm\n\nWednesday: 9:00am – 5:00pm\n\nThursday: 9:00am – 5:00pm\n\nFriday: 9:00am – 5:00pm\n\nSaturday: Closed\n\nSunday: Closed\n\n\n#### Services\n\n\n\n#### About Us\n\n\nPrivacy Policy\n\nDental Website by Progressive Dental Marketing",
